    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d236">

                <pb facs="0319" n="203" xml:id="pg203"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1045.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sullivan to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-29T17:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 29, 1914, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Legation has induced Dominican Government to release all political prisoners
                    including Velásquez who enters his candidacy for the presidency in coming
                    election.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
